のかな？？\n\u003chttps://git.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/InterfacesFrontendsAndTools#Vim\u003e","ts":"1615354075.015900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"god","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pbOp1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fdb31af-8b17-42e5-9ff5-37d5d96f35f7","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"sqls.vimはvim-lspに依存しているので、coc用のはないんですよね。vscodeのプラグインも作ってますが、僕が使わないからあまりメンテしてないです:man-bowing:","ts":"1615343209.015200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w784"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cff6198-8009-4360-8876-f343f8fa945b","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"そういうUIがほしい人いるだろうなと思いつつも依存が多くなりすぎるのでやってないんですよね。","ts":"1615342722.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OtA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9abe882-16c6-4299-be0d-0c99caf31999","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ぼく、 `vim-dadbod-completion` (`coc-db` としてもインストールできる) と `vim-dadbod-ui` を使っているのですがこれもこれで便利ですね。 tpope 先生の `vim-dadbod` を使ったものではあるので宗教上の理由で使わない人もいるかもですが。","ts":"1615342506.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ND0X3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71b60692-0552-4340-acac-fbecc9968315","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"yaml-language-server で正しく設定をすると補完やリントができるようになります。","ts":"1615341651.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Y+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8000d485-e2c8-4d5b-af2c-33b8230ef6ec","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"\u003c@U80CX6XDZ\u003e とりあえず sqls の設定ファイル (`.config/sqls/config.yml`) 用の json schema を作ってみました。 \u003chttps://gist.github.com/yaegassy/5a5ecdabdc4a5623c70e02a2360ce00c\u003e","ts":"1615341636.011900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ds8c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfaa0cdc-8f82-4552-8cd1-59257b44660d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ただ sqls.vim が既にあるのでモチベが...。既に Vim から快適に諸々実行できますしねw","ts":"1615341310.011700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"olO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b88705b-9b53-4e0f-be0c-d494020fab0f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あとは YAML の設定ファイルをシュッと編集できるようにするとか。","ts":"1615341298.011500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"84m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8afbbe4-e976-432f-839f-2aca7ad263a0","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"sqls で coc や VSCode の拡張を作る場合をちょっと考えてみたのですが sqls の最新版ダウンロードのコマンドと、あとは昨日伺ったコードアクション類のコマンド(コネクション張ったりデータベース切り替えたりクエリ実行したり)くらいかなと。","ts":"1615341273.011300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lQK4Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0712c2b8-6e23-4608-a8e5-38e9f3769264","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"\u003c@U7TMPGWJ0\u003e sqlsのvscode拡張を作るときに少しGoのvscode拡張のソースを見たんですけど、設定の複雑さとかそういうのを拡張を実装する人のマンパワーで解消している印象でしたね。やはり各言語やLSの独自仕様を吸収できない部分はプロトコルをざっくり作ってクライアント側頑張ってねという形に見えます。","ts":"1615340673.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PtXr"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01R38ZSMND","text":"\u003c@U01R38ZSMND\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1615335353.009100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
